---
// Full-bleed hero with the master video behind the copy — the ../gitnfit hero layout
// (docs/web_site_redesign_plan.md §2). The loop is K5 (the reveal) → K7 (the live-set screen
// counting curls) → K8 (the form screen judging squats); 23.5 s, silent, dissolved seams.
// Dimmed to 70 % rather than gitnfit's 55 % because the video carries two app screens with
// numbers in them. No floating HUD card any more: the video IS the HUD.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <video
      class="hero__video"
      poster="/video/hero-poster.jpg"
      autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"
    >
      <source src="/video/hero.webm" type="video/webm" />
      <source src="/video/hero.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
    <img class="hero__poster" src="/video/hero-poster.jpg"
         alt="Peter, IronPal's founder, holding the IronPal headband up to the camera in a warmly lit gym." />
  </div>
  <div class="hero__scrim"></div>

  <div class="wrap hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__copy">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Up to ~50% off launch price · first 200 spots</span>
      <h1>Stop logging.<br /><span class="accent">Just lift.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">A headband that watches your set and logs the exercise, your reps, and the weight on the bar — <strong>automatically</strong>. You type nothing.</p>

      <form class="capture" id="reserve" novalidate>
        <div class="capture__row">
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email"
                 placeholder="you@email.com" aria-label="Email address" required />
          <button type="submit" class="btn">Reserve Early-Bird Access</button>
        </div>
        <p class="capture__hint" id="formHint">Lock the early-bird price + a 48-hour head start before public launch.</p>
      </form>
      <p class="trust">Built by a solo founder who got tired of typing reps into an app mid-set.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <span class="hero__tag" aria-hidden="true">Campaign footage · product interface concept</span>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { position: relative; isolation: isolate; display: flex; align-items: center; overflow: hidden;
    /* fill the first screen: the nav overlays the video, so 100vh is the fold exactly. svh where
       supported so phone browser chrome does not push the fold below the visible area. */
    min-height: 100vh; min-height: 100svh; }
  .hero__bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; }
  .hero__video, .hero__poster {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 50%;
    filter: saturate(.85) brightness(.7);
  }
  /* poster sits under the video; the video paints over it once it has a frame */
  .hero__poster { z-index: 0; }
  .hero__video  { z-index: 1; }
  .hero__scrim {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1;
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(16,16,30,.96) 0%, rgba(16,16,30,.78) 38%, rgba(16,16,30,.22) 66%, rgba(16,16,30,.30) 100%),
      linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(16,16,30,.85), transparent 45%);
  }
  .hero__inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; width: 100%; padding-top: 96px; padding-bottom: 64px; }
  .hero__copy { max-width: 600px; }
  .hero__copy h1 { font-size: clamp(46px, 8vw, 92px); margin: 18px 0 20px; text-shadow: 0 2px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
  .lede { font-size: clamp(17px, 2.3vw, 21px); max-width: 34ch; color: #c3c8d6; }
  .trust { font-size: 14px; color: #aab0c2; margin-top: 20px; }

  .hero__tag { position: absolute; right: var(--gutter); bottom: 18px; z-index: 2; font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--body); opacity: .8; }

  /* phones: keep the video, favour the subject (left of centre in K7, centred in K5); the
     right-hand app screens are cropped out and the FormTracking section carries them live */
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .hero__video, .hero__poster { object-position: 35% 50%; }
    .hero__tag { display: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .capture__row { flex-direction: column; }
    .capture :global(.btn) { width: 100%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero__video { display: none; }
  }
</style>
